## {@html style_formatted_text(obj.description)}

### Example Usage
```python
import gradio as gr

def flip(frame):
    return frame[::-1]

with gr.Blocks() as demo:
    webcam = gr.Image(sources=["webcam"], streaming=True)
    webcam.stream(
        flip,
        inputs=[webcam],
        outputs=[webcam],
        transport=gr.WebRTCOptions(
            video_bitrate=dict(min=1000, start=1500, max=4000)
        ),
    )

demo.launch()
```

